The Goal
You are trapped in Slaughter's house. You have 5 days to escape. Find keys, then pick an exit. Each time you get caught, a day is lost.

Keys & Questions
There are 6 keys hidden in hard places — look high, look low, look under things. Picking one up asks 2 questions in a row. A wrong answer resets the key and makes noise that Slaughter hears.

The Three Exits
Kitchen window — needs 3 keys.
Basement back door — needs 4 keys, then run through the backyard to the gate.
Front door — needs 5 keys.
Stand near an exit and press E.

Controls
WASD — move
Mouse (click the game, or drag) or arrow keys — look
Shift — sprint (uses stamina; if it runs out you wait 10 seconds)
C — crouch: slow, silent, and harder to spot
E — pick up keys, open exits, hide, sit, use the TV (look straight at the thing first)
F — swing the frying pan (you must earn it first)
M — mute
The Monsters
Slaughter hunts the house and can follow you up and down the stairs. Angelina hunts the upstairs. Wooden floors creak when you walk, and they walk toward the sound. Sprinting is loud. Crouching is quiet. At night they move faster.

Hiding
Look at a bed and press E to hide under it, or hide in a wardrobe or the backyard playhouse. Hide where they can't see you, then stay still until they walk away.

The Frying Pan
On the kitchen counter. Answer 3 questions in a row to earn it. Then F knocks out Slaughter or Angelina for 60 seconds.

Time
Each day starts at 7:00 AM. One hour in the game is 3 real minutes. At 10:00 PM you fall asleep and the day ends.

Tricks
The TV is loud — turn it on to lure Slaughter to the living room while you sneak elsewhere. Sit in chairs to catch your breath.
